					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 3
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Engulf (13): Wrestling at DX+2 gives the cloaker effective ST 15 for the purpose of grappling. Usually it grabs the head or torso, goes for a pin, and then employs Constriction Attack."
				},
				{
					"id": "AB4V6g6QRBT0Ku0Dw",
					"damage": {
						"type": "cr"
					},
					"usage": "Shadow Shift",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 0
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Shadow Shift (10): The cloaker is able to control shadows (illumination penalty of at least -3) in a circular area with a 3-yard radius. To do so, he must Concentrate and roll IQ. After that he can move the shadows at Move 3, or decrease or increase the illumination penalties it gives by 3. The cloaker rarely uses this in combat when fighting alone, but can use this ability to make his ambush place darker."
				}
			]
