		{
			"id": "A4wJxK4feqiTCP5Cs",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 13, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 12, HP 13, WILL 10, PER 12, FP 12, SPEED 6, MOVE 2, DODGE 10, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
