			"text": "Moan (Alternative Abilities), reach 8 yards: Terror (Hearing) [30/5 = 6] + Affliction 1 (HT; Alternative Enhancements (Nauseated, +30% or Stunning, +5%), +35%; Area Effect, 8 yards, +150%; Emanation, -20%; Hearing-Based, +150%) Resolve as stated by the construction; the source gives no separate resolution text."
